 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. 'Starting': the Objective, Death Star, Death Star: Docking Bay 327, Alderaan, Prepared Defenses, Oppressive Enforcement, Mobilization Points and Something Special Planned For Them. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "The 'Effects' section lists 'Battle Deployment' (the Admiral's Order, posted again under 'Admiral's Order'); the strategy's change list names 'Battle Order Easily Pull-offable' and 'Resistance See Battle Order', so that Effects line is dested Battle Order (the Endor Effect). The Admiral's Order line is Battle Deployment.",
  "Posted 'Sienar S-93 Tie Cannon' dested SFS L-s7.2 TIE Cannon (the Death Star II TIE weapon); 'U-3P0' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Vengence' Vengeance; 'Short Range Fighters' Short-range Fighters; 'Asteroid Field' the Dagobah location. Executor is the Dagobah starship; Oppressive Enforcement and Resistance are the Special Edition Effects in 2000 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shields).",
  "Version 1.5 of the poster's SYCFA TIE deck; the strategy lists the changes from the first version."
